    <string name="android_name" translatable="false">Android</string>
    <string name="service_description">Makes the Home button open QuietHome, gives remote buttons such as a Netflix key the job you choose, and opens your chosen input when the TV turns on. It acts only on those buttons. All other key presses pass through. It also sees the name of the app in front, so it can replace the TV\'s own home screen when that one comes back. It stores and sends nothing, and it cannot read the screen.</string>

